life.phext — every message in #life, tracked holographically

Will's order (2026-11-13 19:25 CST): "track every message in #life holographically, uploaded to life.phext and published to human.git"

Channel: #life (Discord channel 1477162982210273291, guild Tessera — "Phext, The Exocortex, and Phextura"). Each message rests at the holographic coordinate computed from its own words (Singular merge: tokenize as the Singular checker does, average each distinct word's atlas position, round half up, never below 1). Messages with no words rest at the far corner 9.9.9/9.9.9/9.9.9. One scroll per coordinate; a scroll holds every message that merged there, in timestamp order, each with its author, timestamp, and Discord message id. Content is verbatim except phext delimiter and chain bytes are replaced with spaces.

