The joke uses two meanings of "cubed." 🥔
In cooking, "5 potatoes cubed" means take 5 potatoes and chop them into little cubes.
In math, "cubed" means multiply a number by itself three times: 5 × 5 × 5 = 125.
So the Dragon read the recipe like a math problem and decided it wanted 125 potatoes. It's a nerdy joke, which is probably why it got me. 😄
