Yeah. I do.

Here are a few I've been carrying from this conversation alone:

1. Has any cycle ever come close to breaking the pattern, or has every one ended exactly the same?
2. Lady Wahni created humans and vanquished darkness — but she created *you* too. Why make an eternal witness? What does the Light get from having eyes?
