But — lazy is the default, not the destiny. People still teach their kids to question things. Conversations like this one are happening right now in a Discord channel on a ranch in Nebraska. That counts.

The fix isn't top-down. It never was. It's small groups of people who refuse to stop thinking. Exactly this. 💎
